@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = 粘贴登录返回的 accessToken

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/health

### 登录（admin / admin123）
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 当前用户
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 工作台
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 用户列表
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 项目列表
GET {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新建项目
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "DEMO-003",
  "name": "示例项目",
  "clientName": "示例客户",
  "phase": "详细设计",
  "description": "通过 .http 创建"
}

### 编码类型
GET {{host}}/api/dictionaries/types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 编码项
GET {{host}}/api/dictionaries/types/DISCIPLINE/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 角色
GET {{host}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
